{{Quote|This armour pays tribute to the immovable heroes of the front line—those who refuse to acknowledge incoming fire, and consider "dodging" to be an abstract concept akin to cowardice.|[[Armory]] Description}}

'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a set of [[heavy armor]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

==Acquisition==
Both the body armor and [[helmet]] can be bought from the [[Entrenched Division Premium Warbond|Entrenched Division]] page on the [[Superstore]] for {{Currency|SC|250|notext}} and 125 [[Super Credits]], respectively.

==Passive Ability==
{{Armor Passive Info Panel|Concussive Padding, Reinforced}}

==Trivia==
*Due to its armor rating and explosive resistance, it is the only armor that allows a helldiver to survive stepping on an [[MD-6 Anti-Personnel Minefield|MD-6 Anti-Personnel Mine]].
*The body armor is likely inspired by the [https://www.forgottenweapons.com/wwi-german-trench-armor-at-ria/ Grabenpanzer] worn by the [[wp:Imperial German Army|Imperial German Army]] in [[wp:World War I|World War I]].

